<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nac Re cut by Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nac Re cut by Goldman.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it downgraded NAC Re Corp to market perform from outperform.</p>
<p>-- The stock fell 3/4 to 35-3/8 in early morning trade.</p>
</text>
